1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,136
Five things you must do in Papua New Guinea.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,138
Do see the birds of paradise at Port Moresby Nature Park.

3
00:00:09,188 --> 00:00:13,555
Do plan your trip for the Goroka Show in September, with more than 100 tribes.

4
00:00:14,605 --> 00:00:19,063
Do watch the war canoe races at the Kenu and Kundu Festival in Alotau.

5
00:00:20,113 --> 00:00:25,684
Do see Tavurvur, the volcano that buried the town of Rabaul in ash in 1994.

6
00:00:26,734 --> 00:00:31,860
And do watch a Baining fire dance, where masked dancers run right through the flames.
